{
  "body": "Back\nConfigure your new vault.\n\nVault name\n\nVault location\nDevice storage\nRECOMMENDED\nAllows Obsidian data to be accessed by other apps.\nRequires additional permissions.\nApp storage\nYour data will not be accessible to other apps.\nAndroid will delete your data if you uninstall Obsidian.\n\n1.15.0\nCreate a vault",
  "html": "\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"lib/codemirror/codemirror.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"lib/codemirror/overlay.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"lib/codemirror/markdown.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"lib/codemirror/cm-addons.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"lib/codemirror/vim.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"lib/codemirror/meta.min.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"lib/moment.min.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"lib/i18next.min.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"lib/scrypt.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"lib/turndown.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"enhance.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"i18n.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"app.js\"></script>\n\n\n<div class=\"mobile-onboarding\"><div class=\"mobile-onboarding-navbar\"><div class=\"back-button u-pop tappable\" style=\"\">Back</div></div><div class=\"mobile-onboarding-screen\"><h1>Configure your new vault.</h1><form id=\"form\"><p class=\"form-field\"><label>Vault name</label><input type=\"text\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"My vault\" class=\"\"></p><p class=\"form-field\"><label>Vault location</label><div class=\"mobile-onboarding-radio-group\"><div class=\"mobile-onboarding-radio-option is-selected\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"mobile-onboarding-radio-button\"></div><div class=\"mobile-onboarding-radio-content\"><div class=\"mobile-onboarding-radio-option-title\">Device storage<span class=\"flair\">Recommended</span></div><ul class=\"mobile-onboarding-radio-option-desc\"><li>Allows Obsidian data to be accessed by other apps.</li><li>Requires additional permissions.</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"mobile-onboarding-radio-option\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"mobile-onboarding-radio-button\"></div><div class=\"mobile-onboarding-radio-content\"><div class=\"mobile-onboarding-radio-option-title\">App storage</div><ul class=\"mobile-onboarding-radio-option-desc\"><li>Your data will not be accessible to other apps.</li><li>Android will delete your data if you uninstall Obsidian.</li></ul></div></div></div></p></form><footer><div class=\"mod-version\">1.15.0</div></footer><div class=\"button-container\"><button class=\"mod-cta\" data-audit-target=\"button\">Create a vault</button></div></div></div>",
  "globals": [
    "onappinstalled",
    "OBSIDIAN_DEFAULT_I18N"
  ],
  "hasApp": false,
  "commands": null,
  "plugins": null
